╭─ Jobs ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│                                                                                                  │
│ Welcome to gocron                                                                                │
│                                                                                                  │
│ There are no cron jobs in your crontab (file: crontab) yet.                                      │
│                                                                                                  │
│ gocron keeps jobs in your real crontab, so they run whether or not                               │
│ gocron is open. Each job is a comment line plus a cron line:                                     │
│                                                                                                  │
│   # gocron:job id=k3f9a2 name="Nightly backup"                                                   │
│   30 2 * * * pg_dump app > /bk/app.sql                                                           │
│                                                                                                  │
│ Creating jobs here arrives with the editor. Until then, add a line                               │
│ with crontab -e: gocron picks it up within seconds, and a                                        │
│ adopts it.                                                                                       │
│                                                                                                  │
